## 16. Boolean Expressions

A Boolean expression combines inputs using logic operators.

Examples:

```text
A AND B
A OR B
NOT A
(A AND B) OR C
A AND (NOT B)
NOT (A OR B)
```

### Order Matters

Parentheses help show which operation happens first.

Example:

```text
NOT (A OR B)
```

is different from:

```text
(NOT A) OR B
```

